1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,535
The buyer opens the payment link, so what happens to their card next?

2
00:00:03,535 --> 00:00:11,047
The card is entered on the bank's own page, and the bank swaps it for a token, which the tokenization deep dive explains later.

3
00:00:11,047 --> 00:00:15,214
An SMS code goes to the card owner's phone to confirm it's really them.

4
00:00:15,214 --> 00:00:23,357
The bank then debits the card through the processing center using authorization and capture, and timeouts and declines get their own deep dives later.

5
00:00:23,357 --> 00:00:26,952
When the processing center approves, the payment is captured.

